msgid "使用须知文本"
msgstr "Welcome to Mario Forever: Maker Party!\n\nMario Forever: Maker Party is a game with DIY features. Please ensure the following during gameplay:\n· The levels you create shall comply with public order and good morals, and must not contain inappropriate, illegal or non-compliant content such as violence, pornography, vulgarity, discrimination or horror.\n· Abide by local laws and regulations.\n· Do not use the level creation function to produce or spread malicious code, viruses, or design malicious levels that may induce device malfunctions or information leakage for players.\n\nLevel Storage Notice:\n· For level reuse purposes, the levels you create will be automatically cached to other players' local devices during online gameplay; similarly, levels created by other players will also be automatically cached to your local device.\n\nPlayer Data Recording Notice:\n· To support replaying other players' ghosts in play records, your character's position, facing direction, animation state and similar information will be recorded by other players in the same room and saved to their local devices during online gameplay.\n· Likewise, the same information from other players will be recorded and saved to your local device.\n· These records are used only for replay display and do not contain account, identity or other personal information."

